Package: gnome-shell-extension-pardus-daily-wallpaper
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         gnome-shell (>= 45~),
         gir1.2-soup-3.0,
         gir1.2-gtk-4.0,
         gir1.2-adw-1
Description: Automatically download and set daily wallpapers for Pardus
 This GNOME Shell extension automatically downloads and sets daily wallpapers
 from various sources like Bing, NASA, National Geographic, and more.
 .
 It allows you to select preferred sources and maintains a local history of
 downloaded wallpapers.

